    "theorem": "ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.actual_three_character_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_three_character_certificate : (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] [NeZero (3:L)] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.a₂=0 → W.a₄=0 → W.a₆=0 → W.Δ≠0 → ∃ b : Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L)), (frobeniusMatrix W b).det=(Fintype.card F : ZMod 3) ∧ ∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [Algebra K L] [IsScalarTower F K L] [DecidableEq K], (Fintype.card F : ZMod 3)≠1 → ∀ k : ℕ, Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → ((∀ P : (W.baseChange L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion F K L W)) ↔ 3 ∣ Fintype.card F^k-1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [NeZero (3:K)] (a b : K) (hb : b≠0) (Q : (curve a b).Point), (3:ℕ) • Q=0 → (pointValue a b Q)^3=1 ∧ pointValue a b (-Q)=(pointValue a b Q)⁻¹ ∧ (pointValue a b Q=1 ↔ Q=0 ∨ Q=origin a b hb ∨ Q=-(origin a b hb)) ∧ (pointValue a b Q≠1 → ∀ n : ℕ, pointValue a b (Q+n • origin a b hb)=pointValue a b Q)) ∧ (CharP OrdinaryClosure 3 ∧ ordinaryBase.Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (curve (1:OrdinaryClosure) 1))=3 ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (curve (1:OrdinaryClosure) 1))=1 ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Algebra (ZMod 3) K] [Algebra K OrdinaryClosure] [IsScalarTower (ZMod 3) K OrdinaryClosure] [DecidableEq K], ∀ P : (ordinaryBase.baseChange OrdinaryClosure).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion (ZMod 3) K OrdinaryClosure ordinaryBase)) ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, 0<k → ¬3 ∣ 3^k-1) ∧ ¬((∀ P : (ordinaryBase.baseChange OrdinaryClosure).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion (ZMod 3) (ZMod 3) OrdinaryClosure ordinaryBase)) ↔ 3 ∣ 3^1-1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K], ((curve (1:K) 0).Equation 0 0 ∧ ¬(curve (1:K) 0).Nonsingular 0 0) ∧ ((1:K)≠0 ∧ (curve (3:K) 1).Δ=0 ∧ (curve (3:K) 1).Nonsingular 0 0))",
    "decl_sha256": "3a07bd947154ec4b8873abb32288870bdb9c0ffb3e00c39b88a586f09d0bdf80",
    "scope": "Actual cubic torsion character and Frobenius determinant atprime3 for every nonsingular order3normalform a2=a4=a6=0 over everyfinitefieldchar!=3, includingchar2. Actualgeometrictorsion/modulebasisfrompriorgeneralrank; actualoriginpoint/order3, a3nonzero derivedfromactualΔ. Literaldivision/equation/nonsingularity yieldprimitivecubicroot ratio, exactkernel/origintranslations/negation; actualFrobeniuscovariance and constructedorigin-firstactualbasis yielddetq in everybasis. No determinant/rank/pairing premise; existinglinearstep/actualchosenfinitefielddescent givesqualifiedfamilycriterionforallk/compatibleembeddings withqmod3!=1. Genuineordinarychar3modelΔ1/torcard3/modulefinrank1/allalreadyrational in everycompatibleextension, no3|3^k−1fork>0; directunrestrictedsubsetiffnegation, NOToriginalBKnine-pointconditionrefutation. Singularb0/nonzerobΔ0controls. Genericarbitrarycurve coordinate/groupnormalization, canonicalWeil identification, otherprimes/fullBK/allkp500remainopen. Noqualifiedsourcerefutation/fullpaper/bookread/novelty/newnativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
